<Slide style={{ width: 1280, height: 720, background: '#0F1423' }}>
  <Box style={{ position: 'absolute', left: 0, top: 0, width: 1280, height: 720, background: 'linear-gradient(135deg, #0F1423 0%, #2A1810 100%)' }} />
  <Box style={{ position: 'absolute', right: 0, top: 0, width: 620, height: 720, background: 'linear-gradient(200deg, rgba(250,79,36,0.26) 0%, rgba(250,79,36,0) 70%)' }} />

  <Box style={{ position: 'absolute', left: 88, top: 92, width: 1104 }}>
    <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', gap: 14 }}>
      <Box style={{ width: 14, height: 14, background: '#FA4F24' }} />
      <Text style={{ fontSize: 15, color: 'rgba(255,255,255,0.5)', letterSpacing: 3 }}>EA 企业架构咨询方法论 · 第九册</Text>
    </Box>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 58, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#FFFFFF', marginTop: 26, lineHeight: 1.15 }}>
      数据治理<span style={{ color: '#FA4F24' }}>咨询方法论</span>
    </Text>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 19, color: 'rgba(255,255,255,0.72)', marginTop: 22, lineHeight: 1.6, width: 830 }}>
      治理的对象已经不是数据本身了，而是策略、动作、记忆与日志——它要回答「谁能用、用来干什么、出了事谁担责」
    </Text>
    <Box style={{ width: 72, height: 5, background: '#FA4F24', marginTop: 30 }} />

    <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', gap: 10, marginTop: 34 }}>
      {['30 页', '四个部分', '含 Approach 八阶段', '含治理 × 管道 × 知识库 × Agent × Ontology 关系'].map((t, i) => (
        <Box key={t} style={{ height: 32, borderRadius: 16, border: '1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.22)', padding: '0 15px', flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center' }}>
          <Text style={{ fontSize: 13, color: 'rgba(255,255,255,0.78)' }}>{t}</Text>
        </Box>
      ))}
    </Box>
  </Box>

  <Box style={{ position: 'absolute', left: 88, top: 566, flexDirection: 'row', gap: 32 }}>
